  "problem": "$\\frac{{r}^{9}}{{r}^{3}}=$",
  "worked_solution": "We subtract the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{r}^{9}}{{r}^{3}} & = \\\\ {r}^{(9-3)} & = \\\\ {r}^{6} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
